                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1181d390-aa4c-375c-84aa-2a941fc35a1d",
                        "entry_id": "7e2148f8-a063-320b-9110-003fc94f1edb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "увеличивать (увеличить) число женщин, их участие в чём-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "42efc0c9-bf15-4913-9596-e5df8fdfd999",
                                "sense_id": "1181d390-aa4c-375c-84aa-2a941fc35a1d",
                                "text": "Уралжелдорстрою, например, предписали феминизировать трудовой коллектив на 40%, тресту «Востоксталь» ― на 30%, стройиндустрии ― на 40%."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3f2bd120-b597-3270-8fcd-d369238087b3",
                        "entry_id": "7e2148f8-a063-320b-9110-003fc94f1edb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "придавать (придать) женские черты, делать (сделать) более женственным; расслаблять, изнеживать"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7138f962-19d6-43a1-80d4-1594026d9956",
                                "sense_id": "3f2bd120-b597-3270-8fcd-d369238087b3",
                                "text": "Считает, что мы, мужики то есть, мельчаем нынче. Феминизируем."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1197d68d-61c7-3359-baa8-69aff07fe694",
                        "entry_id": "7e2148f8-a063-320b-9110-003fc94f1edb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "лингв. образовывать (образовать) феминативы"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "05750b7c-4a94-4fc6-9099-65961db42ca5",
                                "sense_id": "1197d68d-61c7-3359-baa8-69aff07fe694",
                                "text": "Попытки феминизировать названия профессий были предприняты во Франции дважды, в 1986 и в 1998 годах."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c05ed74f-8767-40d3-9402-3b5a2c23ccc4",
                        "source_entry_id": "7e2148f8-a063-320b-9110-003fc94f1edb",
                        "target_lang_word": "effeminate",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "effeminate",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0f694dc2-68e8-3928-8fb0-767dd6eed028",
                                        "entry_id": "2e07a427-7f74-3d7a-9c85-f544139dfbcf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Exhibiting behaviour or mannerisms considered typical of a woman; unmasculine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "often"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a47376d-db5a-40e0-b44a-86fa92c82bb2",
                                                "sense_id": "0f694dc2-68e8-3928-8fb0-767dd6eed028",
                                                "text": "An effeminate and unmanly foppery."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "269105ad-aa21-46cb-8268-92a67c798025",
                                                "sense_id": "0f694dc2-68e8-3928-8fb0-767dd6eed028",
                                                "text": "The Comte d'Artois had neither the dignified nor the manly air of his brother—he rather appeared like a pretty-looking girl, so effeminate was he and fair."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "372ff352-7701-3185-9c35-6559bf3ca493",
                                        "entry_id": "2e07a427-7f74-3d7a-9c85-f544139dfbcf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Womanly; tender, affectionate, caring."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0cfdd507-2ed9-4b35-af9c-b27aaa76dbb5",
                                                "sense_id": "372ff352-7701-3185-9c35-6559bf3ca493",
                                                "text": "Gentle, kind, effeminate remorse."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "effeminate",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a168b5ac-246c-39c0-a365-2f5e0405acee",
                                        "entry_id": "4c4e581c-73b1-374b-9bea-989e153bd3d8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make womanly; to unman."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic",
                                            "nonstandard",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "687552f6-121a-4076-a21e-0e62c0a08e39",
                                                "sense_id": "a168b5ac-246c-39c0-a365-2f5e0405acee",
                                                "text": "the studie of sciences doth more weaken and effeminate mens minds, than corroborate and adapt them to warre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e116f76-a626-4418-a6ab-93e5a9057c65",
                                                "sense_id": "a168b5ac-246c-39c0-a365-2f5e0405acee",
                                                "text": "It will not corrupt or effeminate their [children's] minds."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4831513c-d6ce-4768-a3f9-e1c07629c01c",
                                                "sense_id": "a168b5ac-246c-39c0-a365-2f5e0405acee",
                                                "text": "I mean the represenstation of gay men on The Simpsons is getting more one-dimensional. For several years Smithers was quite masculine, yet the writers have effeminated him gradually (collecting Barbies, for instance), now he's rollerblading down the street with rainbow hotpants on?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "576af856-4502-3ac3-ab84-805d5fca5c55",
                                        "entry_id": "4c4e581c-73b1-374b-9bea-989e153bd3d8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To become womanly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "effeminate",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ecb87f80-41ef-3dce-bdd8-f0a2de714bc3",
                                        "entry_id": "cb7b6316-d305-3f13-b5c0-76ebe5f3e456",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An effeminate person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc845203-fa91-4a38-a9ea-bf5bed6e196d",
                                                "sense_id": "ecb87f80-41ef-3dce-bdd8-f0a2de714bc3",
                                                "text": "The effeminates are males with obviously recognizable traits and mannerisms; […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "48f6c7c3-bf7b-42bc-8226-c22c90b87fb0",
                        "source_entry_id": "7e2148f8-a063-320b-9110-003fc94f1edb",
                        "target_lang_word": "feminize",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "feminize",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "792e2e42-b572-318d-882f-06439e7ecb63",
                                        "entry_id": "6f567977-59fa-3944-abf0-7534185769ee",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make (more) feminine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8df27fea-4a43-4bfb-8736-f7c53d6a4a8a",
                                                "sense_id": "792e2e42-b572-318d-882f-06439e7ecb63",
                                                "text": "Parabiosis experiments on primitive vertebrates showed inversion of sex in either direction, males were feminized and females masculinized."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4336daf3-08b9-45ce-b1a2-094ed752124b",
                                                "sense_id": "792e2e42-b572-318d-882f-06439e7ecb63",
                                                "text": "The comedies work in very obvious ways to feminize this socially-ominous triad of young fops, old lechers, and greedy businessmen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c23517f3-d33a-4485-b2c6-3aa0a057b354",
                                                "sense_id": "792e2e42-b572-318d-882f-06439e7ecb63",
                                                "text": "For a start, it feminizes Tarquin by drawing on the conventional gendering of the human soul as female (Donne's 'Batter my heart . . .' offers an obvious but interesting comparison), and implies that his physical assault on Lucrece has both offended against his own body and contaminated, almost violated, his spiritual and 'female' self. Rape has almost been self-rape."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd184c9a-216e-4aff-b79e-9e29502a2ede",
                                                "sense_id": "792e2e42-b572-318d-882f-06439e7ecb63",
                                                "text": "Surgical interventions for gender dysphoria, according to WPATH, can include feminizing or masculinizing hormone therapy, voice therapy, chest augmentation and reduction, or genital surgery."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "22c095cc-e143-38bb-ace7-6351e7a0ca5b",
                                        "entry_id": "6f567977-59fa-3944-abf0-7534185769ee",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To become (more) feminine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
